  "body": "UMR-20260806-130110-c620. Applies 3 real precise corrections to the already-dispatched orchestrator scope (UMR-20260806-124327-6ffb / UMR-20260806-125524-720c), mirroring 2 proven, real `repos/compliance-tracker` patterns + 1 already-registered capability, per direct SPEC study.\n\nBuilds on top of #207's real branch tip (`f43af5a`) -- verified genuine, valid, tested code before adding to it (see this branch's own `PROGRESS.md` for the verification trail, including a real finding the SPEC didn't mention: #207 got a Superboss AUDIT FAIL and an unrelated automated fix cycle landed on its branch minutes before this task started).\n\n## 1. Prompt Operating System (mirrors `prompt-os-resolver.ts`, Wave 22)\nReal, versioned, labeled `prompt_templates`/`prompt_versions` tables + `resolve_prompt_template()` (fails loud on a missing template/label, never silently falls back). `unified_orchestrator.step_submission_contract()`'s 2 hardcoded f-string dispatch prompts (`submit_command`/`audit_method`) are now resolved from real rows instead of free-composed prose.\n\n## 2. Structured execution log (mirrors `orchestra-execution-logger.ts`, Wave 23)\nReal `orchestrator_executions` table (org/task/layer/event_type/input/output/model/cost) + `record_orchestrator_execution()`/`log_orchestrator_execution()` (fire-and-forget, never blocks the real step it logs). `status` is always exactly one of `completed`/`failed`/`denied`/`gated`, mirroring the real pattern's own 4-state distinction. `unified_orchestrator.run()` now logs one real row per step 5-10 transition.\n\n## 3. Direct `find_code.sh` call in step 1\n`step_reuse_check` previously only queried `capability_registry`/`wiring_registry`/`knowledge_engine`/`system_index` metadata -- a real gap, since that metadata can be stale/incomplete. It now also runs the already-registered `pruned_code_search` capability (`scripts/find_code.sh`) directly via a new `_run_find_code_search()` helper whenever real `scope_terms` are given, never reimplementing the pruned search logic.\n\n## Tests\n`tests/test_unified_orchestrator.py`: extended the existing real (never-mocked) positive/negative end-to-end tests with assertions on the 3 new corrections, plus 6 new standalone tests. Full `tests/` suite: 358/358 passed. Spot-checked unaffected root-level tests green too.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
